        FileMask: '.claude.json'
        Comment: 'AIRT-0001 | Claude Code: Plaintext third-party secrets embedded in local- and user-scoped MCP server definitions: mcpServers.<name>.env values and mcpServers.<name>.headers (for example an Aut'
