        Category: AIAgents
        Path: 'C:\Users\%user%\AppData\Roaming\Windsurf\User\globalStorage\'
        FileMask: 'state.vscdb'
        Comment: 'AIRT-0006 | Codeium / Windsurf: Windows path for the same Windsurf editor store. ItemTable row ''windsurfAuthStatus'' holds JSON with the apiKey in the clear inside the SQLite DB.'
    -
