    -
        Name: 'Continue.dev: Primary assistant config. Each model block takes an ''apiKey''...'
        Category: AIAgents
        Path: 'C:\Users\%user%\.continue\'
        FileMask: 'config.yaml'
        Comment: 'AIRT-0005 | Continue.dev: Primary assistant config. Each model block takes an ''apiKey'' field that accepts a plaintext provider key written straight into the file; the vendor''s own reference do'
    -
        Name: 'Continue.dev: Deprecated JSON config, still loaded when present. Carries...'
        Category: AIAgents
        Path: 'C:\Users\%user%\.continue\'
        FileMask: 'config.json'
        Comment: 'AIRT-0005 | Continue.dev: Deprecated JSON config, still loaded when present. Carries the same plaintext apiKey field per model. Collect alongside config.yaml - a host upgraded from an older Co'
    -
        Name: 'Continue.dev: Global dotenv that Continue resolves ${{ secrets.X }}...'
        Category: AIAgents
