        FileMask: '.env'
        Comment: 'AIRT-0005 | Continue.dev: Global dotenv that Continue resolves ${{ secrets.X }} references from. Plaintext provider keys in standard dotenv format. Vendor documents this as the recommended alt'
    -
        Name: 'Continue.dev: Continue CLI (''cn'') Hub session: plaintext JSON with...'
