        FileMask: 'auth.json'
        Comment: 'AIRT-0005 | Continue.dev: Continue CLI (''cn'') Hub session: plaintext JSON with accessToken, refreshToken, expiresAt, userId and userEmail, written with a plain writeFileSync and no chmod. Vers'
    -
